{"words": [{"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "He"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "(is) the One Who"}, {"text": "خَلَقَ", "translation": "created"}, {"text": "لَكُم", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "(is) in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "جَمِيعًۭا", "translation": "all"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Moreover"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَوَىٰٓ", "translation": "He turned"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translation": "the heaven"}, {"text": "فَسَوَّىٰهُنَّ", "translation": "and fashioned them"}, {"text": "سَبْعَ", "translation": "seven"}, {"text": "سَمَـٰوَٰتٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "heavens"}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "translation": "And He"}, {"text": "بِكُلِّ", "translation": "of every"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍ", "translation": "thing"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۭ", "translation": "(is) All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "It is He who created for you all of that which is on the earth. Then He directed Himself1 to the heaven, [His being above all creation], and made them seven heavens, and He is Knowing of all things."}